        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c53b189e-2276-54a2-89b1-acef1ba5fb62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kool Kojak, Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse and Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, Warren G, Danny DeVito, Ed Helms, Zac Efron, Savan Kotecha, Victoria Justice\n- Works: Dr. Seuss's The Lorax, The Lorax (film), Best Friend's Brother, Victorious, Victorious soundtrack\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n- Topics: music production, songwriting, film casting\n\nFacts:\n- Kool Kojak has written and produced for artists including Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse and Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, N.A.S.A., Dirt Nasty, Lordz of Brooklyn, Ursula 1000, and Warren G.\n- Kool Kojak has also written and produced for Dr. Seuss's The Lorax.\n- In The Lorax film, Danny DeVito played the Lorax, Ed Helms played the Once-ler, and Zac Efron played Ted.\n- In 2011, Kool Kojak produced \"Best Friend's Brother\" and co-wrote it with Savan Kotecha and Victoria Justice for the soundtrack to the Nickelodeon television series Victorious.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
